WEBVTT

00:00.670 --> 00:03.600
We will now commence the final 
match of the rookie bracket!

00:03.990 --> 00:05.980
I will be winning this.

00:06.250 --> 00:08.020
No, I will.

00:08.310 --> 00:10.530
Then, let's settle this!

00:10.780 --> 00:11.870
Let's!

00:12.920 --> 00:16.150
I will... never lose!

00:16.550 --> 00:18.860
Ogre Scintilla!

00:27.640 --> 00:30.170
Amelia!

00:30.170 --> 00:32.590
Get up!

00:34.380 --> 00:36.390
Prima materia encoding

00:35.180 --> 00:37.390
material code decoding

00:36.680 --> 00:38.510
material code processing

00:36.930 --> 00:39.140
αiτία hū́lē eîdos 
efficient télos embodiment

00:39.140 --> 00:39.890
Causality.

00:53.810 --> 00:55.460
Butterfly Effect.

01:05.460 --> 01:07.150
Huh? Wha?

01:07.150 --> 01:09.060
W-Wait a second!

01:18.680 --> 01:20.880
Ariane, I told you.

01:21.330 --> 01:23.280
You can no longer reach me.

01:23.940 --> 01:26.860
Hey, Ray, what's going on there?

01:26.860 --> 01:27.970
That's...

01:28.550 --> 01:32.410
That's probably a concept 
interference original.

01:32.410 --> 01:33.500
A concept type?!

01:33.500 --> 01:37.180
I believe it takes its source from chaos 
theory's butterfly effect.

01:37.180 --> 01:41.400
Very special sorcery that barely 
anyone in this world can use.

01:41.730 --> 01:43.570
Manipulating causality...

01:44.190 --> 01:48.870
Interfering with causal relationships 
that were supposed to occur,

01:48.870 --> 01:49.990
making them collapse,

01:49.990 --> 01:52.100
then tying them to other causalities,

01:52.100 --> 01:53.610
thus overwriting them...

01:55.510 --> 01:58.850
That's why, no matter how hard Ariane tries,

01:58.850 --> 02:01.440
her attacks won't hit Amelia.

02:01.440 --> 02:07.560
Um, so does that mean that 
Amelia is invincible right now?

02:08.230 --> 02:11.780
Hm, I'm not sure about that one.

02:14.330 --> 02:17.370
Ariane, let's call it quits.

02:17.840 --> 02:19.110
No...

02:19.110 --> 02:23.150
I... I will never lose!

02:24.110 --> 02:26.090
Butterfly Effect!

02:51.980 --> 02:55.730
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

03:54.750 --> 03:57.960
<b>Episode 9
The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Releases the Binds</b>

04:09.780 --> 04:12.220
Father! My sister!

04:12.220 --> 04:13.220
Ariane...

04:13.220 --> 04:14.230
Yeah!

04:14.230 --> 04:15.770
You got this, Amelia!

04:27.360 --> 04:31.200
This is quite taxing for Amelia's engram.

04:32.110 --> 04:35.120
She's definitely 
close to overheating.

04:35.120 --> 04:35.670
Huh?!

04:40.510 --> 04:41.790
Amelia!

04:44.390 --> 04:47.290
I will... never... lose!

04:48.720 --> 04:50.230
Neither will I!

05:15.990 --> 05:17.320
Ariane!

05:17.320 --> 05:18.710
Sister!

05:19.660 --> 05:20.600
Amelia!

05:20.600 --> 05:21.840
Amelia!

05:26.710 --> 05:28.920
Keep fighting, Amelia!

05:39.380 --> 05:41.910
Amelia!

05:41.910 --> 05:45.290
Ariane!

06:05.610 --> 06:06.830
Ariane...

06:08.860 --> 06:10.210
Amelia...

06:11.830 --> 06:14.300
Your face looks terrible.

06:14.300 --> 06:16.690
Your body is covered in burns, too.

06:16.690 --> 06:19.760
The same goes for you, too, Ariane.

06:21.120 --> 06:22.630
You're right.

06:23.620 --> 06:25.500
Hey, Amelia.

06:25.500 --> 06:26.030
Yes?

06:26.590 --> 06:31.140
You've... gotten very strong.

06:33.770 --> 06:34.650
Yes.

06:36.060 --> 06:41.330
I... I've gotten strong!

06:42.380 --> 06:43.380
Yes.

06:43.380 --> 06:45.320
It's really amazing.

06:46.000 --> 06:48.280
Yes... Yes!

06:50.180 --> 06:53.020
Why are you crying?

06:53.020 --> 06:55.700
You defeated me, you know?

06:55.700 --> 06:58.310
You know you can be proud, right?

06:59.410 --> 07:03.700
I only got this far because 
of everyone's help.

07:04.560 --> 07:06.810
The friends I made at school...

07:06.810 --> 07:10.610
And Ray helped me so much.

07:12.310 --> 07:13.830
But you know...

07:13.830 --> 07:16.990
the reason I was able to become strong

07:18.970 --> 07:20.640
was because of you, Ariane.

07:24.130 --> 07:26.810
Because you were always there,

07:26.810 --> 07:29.120
ahead of me, I was able to make it this far.

07:31.550 --> 07:34.600
So... thank you.

07:37.000 --> 07:38.570
Thank you, too.

07:40.760 --> 07:44.990
I was only able to pursue 
being a proud aristocrat

07:44.990 --> 07:48.650
so that I could become an example for you.

07:48.650 --> 07:49.530
Huh?

07:50.610 --> 07:52.020
I knew you had doubts.

07:52.640 --> 07:55.130
Doubts about how aristocrats should be,

07:55.130 --> 07:57.860
how you should be.

07:58.630 --> 08:02.770
But I didn't know how to 
talk to you about that.

08:03.470 --> 08:08.000
That's why I decided that I'd always be 
someone that you wouldn't be ashamed of.

08:10.850 --> 08:13.300
Amelia, I'm so sorry.

08:17.370 --> 08:18.750
Amelia.

08:18.750 --> 08:22.010
We will always be friends.

08:23.850 --> 08:25.020
Yes.

08:25.020 --> 08:27.150
Always, always.

08:27.150 --> 08:29.260
Always, always, always.

08:35.860 --> 08:38.690
Ariane!

08:38.690 --> 08:43.150
I brought everything I had into this fight.

08:43.590 --> 08:46.170
And I lost.

08:48.500 --> 08:50.740
Congratulations, Amelia!

08:51.500 --> 08:53.550
You are the champion!

08:56.050 --> 08:59.270
Thank you... Ariane!

09:00.090 --> 09:03.380
Th-The match is over!

09:03.380 --> 09:07.410
The champion of the rookie 
bracket is Amelia Rose!

09:07.410 --> 09:09.630
That was an amazing battle!

09:09.630 --> 09:12.020
Both of you were really cool!

09:12.020 --> 09:13.570
That's true!

09:13.570 --> 09:14.930
Dear audience,

09:14.930 --> 09:18.460
please give both of them a huge hand for 
fighting it out valiantly until the end!

09:19.030 --> 09:20.470
Yay!

09:19.460 --> 09:21.530
You did great, Amelia!

09:23.020 --> 09:25.540
They were so cool!

09:25.540 --> 09:27.060
Yes!

09:46.990 --> 09:48.830
Uncle Claude!

09:49.430 --> 09:50.860
Uncle!

09:50.860 --> 09:52.010
Oh, it's you, Tiana.

09:52.010 --> 09:53.700
Hey, Claude!

09:53.980 --> 09:56.300
Amelia was amazing.

09:56.860 --> 09:58.190
She's not there yet.

09:58.190 --> 10:00.270
Sheesh, just be happy for once.

10:00.710 --> 10:02.230
She lost this time,

10:02.230 --> 10:04.440
but Ariane is going to get even stronger.

10:04.440 --> 10:05.190
Yeah!

10:05.760 --> 10:09.230
Then, Amelia will get even stronger...

10:12.130 --> 10:15.930
How great is it to have a 
childhood friend and rival!

10:15.930 --> 10:16.770
Hmph.

10:23.020 --> 10:23.940
Ray!

10:23.940 --> 10:26.220
Amelia, how are you feeling?

10:26.220 --> 10:28.650
I'm fine now.

10:28.650 --> 10:30.980
Well, I guess I look like this.

10:30.980 --> 10:32.320
You'll recover soon.

10:32.750 --> 10:33.550
Yeah.

10:34.780 --> 10:38.110
Now that it's over, it feels 
like it was just a flash.

10:38.650 --> 10:40.710
There were some rough parts,

10:41.070 --> 10:43.210
but I didn't hate it all.

10:43.930 --> 10:47.740
I want to keep living, next to you.

10:49.240 --> 10:52.110
No, I mean, I know!

10:52.110 --> 10:55.840
That you meant that as 
a friend, but still...

10:55.840 --> 10:57.170
What happened?

10:57.660 --> 10:59.220
Nothing!

11:00.520 --> 11:04.970
By the way, did you know what my power was?

11:05.240 --> 11:08.470
No, not in detail.

11:08.870 --> 11:10.220
But during our training,

11:10.700 --> 11:13.680
I did feel that you have tremendous talent.

11:15.060 --> 11:17.700
Oh, I see.

11:18.140 --> 11:21.440
Talent may be hereditary,

11:21.440 --> 11:23.070
but today's fight was—

11:23.070 --> 11:25.230
Because I tried so hard...

11:26.320 --> 11:27.360
Right?

11:28.550 --> 11:29.840
Of course.

11:30.270 --> 11:33.670
Original spells are not something you just 
happen to attain without any effort.

11:34.040 --> 11:37.900
It was the proof that you've 
been working hard for a long time.

11:39.780 --> 11:40.920
Congratulations.

11:40.920 --> 11:44.270
Once again, from the bottom of my heart.

11:44.560 --> 11:46.530
Thank you, Ray!

11:46.530 --> 11:48.510
Truly, thank you, thank you so mu—

11:57.310 --> 11:59.400
<i>If I hadn't met Ray,</i>

11:59.400 --> 12:02.830
<i>I think I'd still be that bird in a cage.</i>

12:03.440 --> 12:05.880
<i>Limiting myself instead of really giving it my all,</i>

12:05.880 --> 12:08.260
<i>and whining with my head down.</i>

12:10.430 --> 12:15.980
<i>I had forgotten for so long that there's an 
endless blue sky, if you just lift your head.</i>

12:17.630 --> 12:19.460
Amelia!

12:19.900 --> 12:22.100
Yes! Coming!

12:24.810 --> 12:27.350
Today's finally the final 
of the main bracket!

12:27.870 --> 12:30.640
Let's cheer hard for Rebecca, as well.

12:30.640 --> 12:31.350
Yeah!

12:32.570 --> 12:35.310
<i>I, Amelia Rose,</i>

12:35.310 --> 12:38.000
<i>am no longer a bird trapped 
in the cage of nobility.</i>

12:43.600 --> 12:48.510
<i>I am going to live in this whole 
wide world, alongside everybody else!</i>

12:52.810 --> 12:56.080
It's finally time for the climax 
of the Magic Chevalier!

12:56.080 --> 12:58.960
The favorite for the title 
of champion is Lady Rebecca...

12:59.510 --> 13:02.410
I mean, Rebecca Bradley.

13:02.420 --> 13:06.140
Facing her will be the dark horse who 
quickly rushed up the ranks, Lucas Forst!

13:12.850 --> 13:14.440
<i>That's...</i>

13:18.690 --> 13:23.980
Who will the goddess of victory be 
smiling upon in this final match?!

13:25.920 --> 13:27.580
I look forward to our fight.

13:29.840 --> 13:31.370
The fight is on!

13:51.020 --> 13:52.390
Eighth Secret Technique.

14:01.350 --> 14:03.090
Afterglow Blackout.

14:14.670 --> 14:16.240
Thank you.

14:19.260 --> 14:20.960
It-It's over!

14:20.960 --> 14:23.030
It took just a moment.

14:23.640 --> 14:28.040
The champion of the main bracket of 
the Magic Chevalier is Lucas Forst!

14:28.620 --> 14:33.800
The dark horse of this tournament 
has finally claimed the top title!

14:33.800 --> 14:36.550
Everybody, please give him a huge hand!

14:45.090 --> 14:48.060
You're the current Iceblade, right?

14:48.350 --> 14:52.280
I didn't know the "Peerless Blade Sorcerer" 
title had also been passed down.

14:52.630 --> 14:54.010
You could tell?

14:54.010 --> 14:57.250
How could I not, after seeing 
that secret technique.

14:58.470 --> 14:59.580
I figured.

15:00.220 --> 15:02.610
I thought you might.

15:03.810 --> 15:05.230
Why?

15:05.230 --> 15:07.920
I don't see what reason the 
"Peerless Blade Sorcerer"

15:07.920 --> 15:11.050
has for competing in the Magic Chevalier, 
which is a tournament for students.

15:11.640 --> 15:15.180
I wanted to show you.

15:17.270 --> 15:19.690
I want to fight against the Iceblade.

15:21.310 --> 15:26.710
I wanted you to see that the strongest 
sorcerer is the Peerless Blade.

15:29.560 --> 15:33.580
But first, please fully cure your overheat.

15:34.300 --> 15:37.330
Otherwise I can't fight you
with my full strength.

15:38.180 --> 15:39.670
See you next year.

15:39.670 --> 15:41.040
I'll be waiting here.

15:46.210 --> 15:47.680
Next year, huh...?

15:49.330 --> 15:50.840
Ah, man.

15:50.840 --> 15:53.910
So the tournament's already 
coming to an end.

15:53.910 --> 15:55.960
That's kinda sad.

15:55.960 --> 15:58.340
It was just too fast.

15:58.340 --> 16:00.470
This Dumbpink is so annoying.

16:00.820 --> 16:02.830
I can't believe you actually hired her!

16:02.830 --> 16:03.980
Oh, yowch!

16:03.980 --> 16:07.400
Lydia, you're always so mean.

16:07.400 --> 16:10.940
But I know that you actually love me!

16:10.940 --> 16:12.280
You're such a tsundere!

16:12.280 --> 16:15.110
Abbie, seriously, can I hurt her?

16:15.540 --> 16:17.060
Control yourself, Lydia.

16:17.060 --> 16:19.070
Now's really not the time for that.

16:19.760 --> 16:20.910
Yeah, yeah.

16:24.330 --> 16:26.150
Do it, please.

16:26.930 --> 16:28.090
You betcha!

16:28.090 --> 16:29.180
Listen up!

16:29.180 --> 16:31.110
Everything's going to be fine soon!

16:31.110 --> 16:33.750
Baddies, look here!

16:34.090 --> 16:35.810
Let's get going!

16:36.720 --> 16:39.090
Carol in Wonderland!

16:39.090 --> 16:41.030
Pew pew!

16:51.930 --> 16:53.280
Turn right!

16:53.800 --> 16:55.240
Turn left!

16:55.770 --> 16:57.710
Now spin!

16:58.280 --> 16:59.630
Jump to the left!

16:59.630 --> 17:01.460
Step to the right!

17:01.700 --> 17:03.150
Hands to your hips!

17:03.150 --> 17:07.160
Close your knees and shake those hips!

17:07.160 --> 17:09.960
She really is the 
"Spellbinding Sorcerer", huh?

17:07.160 --> 17:11.410
Shake, shake, shake.

17:09.960 --> 17:11.410
It's in such poor taste.

17:11.410 --> 17:12.860
And one more time!

17:12.860 --> 17:15.750
Dumbpink! Stop playing and do it already!

17:16.400 --> 17:17.760
All right!

17:18.070 --> 17:21.270
Now, let's get to it.

17:21.840 --> 17:28.770
Spit out everything about your 
bosses and your future plans!

17:29.070 --> 17:34.020
Come on, release all 
of your pubescent worries!

17:41.120 --> 17:41.990
Ow...

17:43.200 --> 17:45.500
So this is how the Empire does it, huh?

17:45.500 --> 17:46.600
Despicable.

17:46.600 --> 17:49.130
That's in bad taste!

17:49.880 --> 17:52.070
It's the closing ceremony of 
the Magic Chevalier tournament

17:52.070 --> 17:54.370
and all the contestants have gathered here!

17:54.970 --> 17:57.890
They are being showered 
by relentless applause

17:57.890 --> 18:00.560
for having endured four 
days of intense fighting!

18:04.700 --> 18:07.410
Congratulations, Amelia!

18:07.410 --> 18:08.890
Congrats!

18:11.820 --> 18:13.940
Phew, I made it!

18:13.940 --> 18:17.090
Miss Carol, where have you been?!

18:17.610 --> 18:20.600
A girl's got secrets!

18:20.600 --> 18:24.020
Right... And who's that next to you?

18:25.410 --> 18:26.560
Don't worry about me.

18:26.560 --> 18:28.100
Just a beautiful girl, passing through.

18:28.100 --> 18:28.880
Wha?

18:28.880 --> 18:31.400
Dina, your next line!

18:31.820 --> 18:36.030
Oh, and now the closing speech from the 
chair of the tournament organizers,

18:36.030 --> 18:39.550
the principal of the Arnold Academy 
of Sorcery, Abbie Garnet!

18:40.090 --> 18:44.390
This year's Magic Chevalier has 
concluded safely!

18:44.670 --> 18:46.870
While you are all students,

18:46.870 --> 18:50.380
all of you showed us battles 
on an extremely high level.

18:50.710 --> 18:55.600
And many thanks to our audience and our 
staff for cheering everybody on, as well.

18:55.600 --> 18:59.660
I look forward to seeing you here 
in this arena again next year!

18:59.660 --> 19:00.900
That is all!

19:08.120 --> 19:09.910
For this year's cultural festival,

19:09.910 --> 19:12.830
I suggest that our class should be run

19:12.830 --> 19:14.880
a maid cafe!

19:16.800 --> 19:18.770
What is the meaning of this?!

19:18.770 --> 19:20.790
Why do we have to pretend to be servants?!

19:20.790 --> 19:22.240
We're nobles!

19:22.240 --> 19:23.290
A cafe with maids?!

19:23.290 --> 19:24.660
And the maids serve tea?

19:24.290 --> 19:25.220
I mean, probably.

19:24.660 --> 19:27.160
I can't be a maid!

19:29.530 --> 19:35.060
Classes and clubs need to get approval
to be in the cultural festival.

19:35.060 --> 19:36.180
So to begin with,

19:36.180 --> 19:39.920
we need to get consent during 
tomorrow's class vote.

19:39.920 --> 19:42.570
Hm, I got the gist of it.

19:42.570 --> 19:47.860
But what, exactly, is it that you want do so 
badly that you're willing to be an organizer?

19:48.910 --> 19:49.820
This.

19:51.880 --> 19:53.160
A maid cafe?

19:54.370 --> 19:55.970
This is an excellent proposal.

19:55.970 --> 19:59.670
Wouldn't this garner everyone's 
support if you just submitted this?

20:00.330 --> 20:03.670
We have a lot of highborn 
girls in our class, right?

20:03.880 --> 20:06.830
Do you think they would 
willingly become maids?

20:06.830 --> 20:08.420
Now that you mention it...

20:08.420 --> 20:11.190
Just suggesting this won't work.

20:11.190 --> 20:14.150
That's why I wanted to ask for your help.

20:14.440 --> 20:17.210
But how am I, as a guy, going to—

20:17.210 --> 20:18.790
Ray! Listen!

20:18.790 --> 20:19.290
Yes?

20:19.510 --> 20:21.610
In the face of the wonderfulness of maids,

20:21.610 --> 20:25.070
male or female... none of that matters!

20:26.460 --> 20:27.530
Maids!

20:27.530 --> 20:30.610
Their existence alone is 
already so attractive!

20:30.900 --> 20:33.450
When you think that they are always 
just loyal to their master,

20:33.450 --> 20:36.180
sometimes they have the captivating 
expression of a goddess!

20:36.180 --> 20:38.160
And that uniform is splendid, as well!

20:38.160 --> 20:39.340
While it isn't flashy,

20:39.340 --> 20:42.130
there is a modest, yet noble, beauty there!

20:42.560 --> 20:43.650
Oh...

20:44.650 --> 20:45.800
That's true!

20:45.800 --> 20:48.060
Certainly not someone 
to look down on!

20:48.060 --> 20:49.020
Maid in heaven!

20:49.020 --> 20:50.760
Welcome to my destiny!

20:50.760 --> 20:52.540
You get it, right?! Right?!

20:52.540 --> 20:53.240
Yeah!

20:53.900 --> 20:59.700
My suggestion is that the maid outfit at the 
cultural festival will have a shorter skirt!

20:59.930 --> 21:01.580
It's a departure from the standard,

21:01.580 --> 21:04.840
but I think it will be ideal for 
a casual foray into maiddom!

21:04.840 --> 21:06.980
The length of the skirt makes a difference?

21:06.980 --> 21:09.130
Yes! Of course it does!

21:09.900 --> 21:10.820
Actually,

21:10.820 --> 21:13.690
we ought to be pushing to make 
this style the standard trend!

21:14.220 --> 21:17.320
The maids who used to live in the shadow
of their masters

21:17.320 --> 21:19.560
are finally declaring they exist!

21:19.560 --> 21:21.330
Don't you think that's revolutionary?!

21:22.440 --> 21:24.590
I think that sounds really good!

21:24.590 --> 21:29.280
Carocaro thinks you guys would 
all make for very cute maids!

21:30.210 --> 21:31.270
Behold!

21:32.070 --> 21:33.090
Tada!

21:42.710 --> 21:44.890
I'm so glad that went well.

21:44.890 --> 21:47.860
I hope we didn't strong-arm 
them all into this.

21:47.860 --> 21:49.580
It's fine, it's fine!

21:49.580 --> 21:51.810
Your passionate speech was very moving.

21:51.810 --> 21:52.750
Impressive.

21:53.010 --> 21:54.550
If we're talking about impressive,

21:54.550 --> 21:58.140
I think that applies to you more for having 
brought Carol on board before, as well.

21:58.140 --> 21:59.180
Ray!

22:00.690 --> 22:02.090
Miss Sera?

22:02.090 --> 22:03.530
Did something happen?

22:03.530 --> 22:06.340
Rebecca... She...

22:06.340 --> 22:07.780
Did something happen to her?

22:08.180 --> 22:10.020
Apparently, she got "engaged"!

23:49.990 --> 23:54.990
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

23:49.990 --> 23:54.990
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:49.990 --> 23:54.990
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:50.400 --> 23:51.890
This is the preview of the next episode of

23:51.890 --> 23:54.260
<i>The Iceblade Sorcerer 
Shall Rule the World</i>!

23:55.000 --> 23:56.630
The cultural festival is a can't-miss event!

23:56.630 --> 23:59.120
Everyone comes together
in their love of elegant frills.

23:59.120 --> 24:02.490
They say that this outfit is so 
attractive that nobody can resist.

24:02.490 --> 24:06.210
"The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest 
Sorcerer Sets Up a Maid Cafe"!

24:05.500 --> 24:10.010
<b>Episode 10
The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Sets Up a Maid Cafe</b>

24:06.690 --> 24:09.300
This has been Ariane Algren.
